cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "Two is better than one: A Collapse-Resistant Multi-Reward RLIF Training Framework"
abstract: >-
  A collapse-resistant multi-reward framework for reinforcement learning from
  internal feedback, combining an answer-level cluster-voting reward with a
  completion-level self-certainty reward under per-channel GDPO normalization
  and covariance-aware KL regularization (KL-Cov).
